WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Homework Helper, Parents Explains the homework skill to the parent,

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:09.670
then gives step-by-step hints and a practice example to do together, never the final answer.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.160
How to use it, open it, read what it asks,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:18.880
then copy it into a chatbot or rent it in the demo store. Tap Go there to open it.
